Public corpus of cr-legislative-coverage
https://github.com/DariALV/cr-legislative-coverage

This dataset is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0), except for
the parts listed below. Full legal text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

You may share and adapt it for any purpose, as long as you give appropriate credit, link to the license and say
whether you made changes. Suggested credit: "cr-legislative-coverage public corpus (2026), CC BY 4.0".

Parts under other terms:

1. Data of the Asamblea Legislativa de Costa Rica (tables bills, bill_steps, bill_subjects, bill_proponents,
   bill_texts, laws, deputies, deputy_terms, deputy_factions, deputy_replacements, deputy_bills, organs,
   organ_memberships, organ_bills). Official public information taken from the Sistema de Información Legislativa
   (SIL), https://www.asamblea.go.cr. Credit the Asamblea Legislativa de Costa Rica as the source when you reuse it.

2. News metadata (tables news_articles and news_bill_links). Titles, URLs, bylines and dates belong to each outlet
   (CRHoy, La Nación, Delfino, El Mundo CR, Semanario Universidad) and are included only to identify and cite each
   item. They are not covered by this license. The text of the news items is not part of the corpus: read it at
   the outlet's URL.

The links between news and bills, the answers of the Jev evaluator and the derived tables are the project's own
work and fall under CC BY 4.0. They are model output and are provided as is, without warranty of accuracy. See README.md, "Limitations".
